# 2026-02-01 日志

## 路径策略修复 (15:30)

### 问题
- prompts-workflow skill 中路径策略不统一
- `convert()` 使用硬编码绝对路径 `/root/clawd/scripts/convert-prompts-to-skills.py`
- `collect()` 和 `publish()` 使用相对路径
- `collect.sh` 中多处使用硬编码绝对路径

### 影响
- ❌ 不能移植到其他环境
- ❌ 安装 skill 到不同位置会失效
- ❌ 打包分享时会出问题

### 解决方案
统一使用**环境变量 + 相对路径**策略：

**修改 main.js:**
```javascript
const CLAWD_ROOT = process.env.CLAWD_ROOT || '/root/clawd';
const SCRIPTS_DIR = join(CLAWD_ROOT, 'scripts');

async convert() {
  const convertScript = join(SCRIPTS_DIR, 'convert-prompts-to-skills.py');
  // ...
}
```

**修改 collect.sh:**
```bash
CLAWD_ROOT="${CLAWD_ROOT:-/root/clawd}"
REPORT_DIR="${CLAWD_ROOT}/reports"
LOG_FILE="${CLAWD_ROOT}/data/prompts/all-sources-collection.log"

python3 "${CLAWD_ROOT}/scripts/collect-reddit-prompts.py"
python3 "${CLAWD_ROOT}/scripts/collect-github-prompts.py"
python3 "${CLAWD_ROOT}/scripts/collect-hackernews.py"
python3 "${CLAWD_ROOT}/scripts/collect-prompts-test.py"
```

### 优点
- ✅ 默认兼容当前环境 (`/root/clawd`)
- ✅ 可通过环境变量灵活配置
- ✅ 打包分享时设置正确路径即可
- ✅ 统一的路径策略

### 修改的文件
- `/root/clawd/skills/prompts-workflow/main.js`
- `/root/clawd/skills/prompts-workflow/scripts/collect.sh`
- `/root/clawd/skills/prompts-workflow/scripts/publish.sh`

